    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1: Grading (AI draft)\nGleams sends a hand-in here. The AI drafts rubric scores. A Code node checks them and works out the total (the AI total is never trusted). The draft is saved in the grade_drafts table and the instructor gets an email to approve or reject. Nothing is final until the instructor approves (Workflow 2).",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 3400,
